    "text": "By Colton Pool ,\n1 days ago At one point, it seemed like Memphis was going to appear in the College Football Playoff as a Group of Six program in 2025. The Tigers started out 6-0 overall, including a win over Arkansas. They suffered a setback with an upset loss at UAB, but then they bounced back with wins over South Florida and Rice. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
